      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We've got a little bit of content VRChat has created over time (Battle Discs, Steel N Gold, CTF, etc), but we do primarily rely on the community to create content. This is one of the core pillars of VRChat-- community-created content.\n\nThe development team is pretty busy working on the VRChat application itself, but when we get time, we definitely would love to work on more content. Finding that time, however, is the challenge!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
