      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I get they're \"busy\" and I get its \"hard\" so maybe put that HTC investment money to good use and HIRE HELP. \n\nhttps://xjockalbanyny.com/2015/01/08/five-things-you-could-buy-for-4-5-million-dollars-instead-of-a-thirty-second-super-bowl-commercial-on-nbc/",
