      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Personally I love that everything is user creating. It's part of what makes VRChat a unique experience. But I definitely think the devs need to do a much, MUCH better job at curating so that quality content is easier to find.\n\nCommunity Spotlight is just utter trash. Yes! I know the Void Club exists. I've known for the last 600hrs I've played. Please show me something... anything else.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
