      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I feel like a \"map of the day\" suggestion, where the map would be predefined by the number of users in the previous day and by the fact that the same map cannot ever be selected twice, would be an easy way to aggregate players on a new map.\nHopefully, the new UI that is expected to come addresses some of the problems with the worlds tab (which is a bit cluttered imo).",
